description: >
  Dragon Lord’s Fury [Triggered, 1/Round]: If an Ally is hit by an Attacking Maneuver from a Studied Opponent, you may use the Intervene Maneuver without spending a Counter Action.
text: >
  Dragon Lord’s Fury [Triggered, 1/Round]: If an Ally is hit by an Attacking Maneuver from a Studied Opponent, you may use the Intervene Maneuver without spending a Counter Action.

